<title>UK: Treatt full-year profits decline.</title>
<headline>Treatt full-year profits decline.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.3		   vs 23.55</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.8		    vs 3.8</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.7		    vs 5.6</p>
<p> Pretax		     1.5		    vs 3.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   29.4		   vs 28.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits of around 2.0 million stg for the company, which supplies essential oils and aromatic chemicals for a variety of sectors including the food industry.</p>
</text>
